BESSEL FUNCTIONS OF FRACTIONAL ORDER (p.1)
Spherical Bessel Functions of the Second and Third Kind
10.1.15
y_{n}(z)=(-1)^{n+1}j_{n-1}(z)\quad(n=0,\pm1,\pm2,\ldots)
10.1.16
h_{n}^{(0)}(z)=i^{n-1}z^{-1}e^{t\frac{n}{2}\sum\limits_0^0 (n+1/2,k)(-2iz)^{-k}}
10.1.17
h_{n}^{(0)}(z)=i^{n+1}z^{-1}e^{t\frac{n}{2}\sum\limits_0^0 (n+1/2,k)(2iz)^{-k}}
10.1.18
h_{n-1}^{(1)}(z)=i(-1)^{n}h_{n}^{(1)}(z)\quad h_{n-1}^{(1)}(z)=-i(-1)^{n}h_{n}^{(1)}(z)\quad(n=0,1,2,\ldots)
Elementary Properties Recurrence Relations
f_{n}(z):j_{n}(z), y_{n}(z), h_{n}^{(1)}(z), h_{n}^{(2)}(z)
(n=0,\pm1,\pm2,\ldots)
10.1.19
f_{n-1}(z)+f_{n+1}(z)=(2n+1)z^{-1}f_{n}(z)
10.1.20
nf_{n-1}(z)-(n+1)f_{n+1}(z)=(2n+1)\;\frac{d}{dz}\;f_{n}(z)
10.1.21
\frac{n+1}{z}\;f_{n}(z)+\frac{d}{dz}\;f_{n}(z)=f_{n-1}(z)
(See 10.1.23.)
10.1.22
\frac{n}{z}f_{n}(z)-\frac{d}{dz}f_{n}(z)=f_{n+1}(z)
(See 10.1.24.)
Differentiation Formulas
f_{n}(z):j_{n}(z), y_{n}(z), h_{n}^{(1)}(z), h_{n}^{(2)}(z)
(n=0,\pm1,\pm2,\ldots)
10.1.23
\Bigl(\frac{1}{z}\frac{d}{dz}\Bigr)^{m}[z^{n+1}f_{n}(z)]=z^{n-m+1}f_{n-m}(z)
10.1.24
\Bigl(\frac{1}{z}\frac{d}{dz}\Bigr)^{m}[z^{-nf}f_{n}(z)]=(-1)^{m}z^{-n-mf}_{n+m}(z)
(m=1,2,3,\ldots)
Rayleigh's Formulas
10.1.25
j_{n}(z)=z^{n}\left(-\frac{1}{z}\frac{d}{dz}\right)^{n}\sin z\;
10.1.26
y_{n}(z)=-z^{n}\left(-\frac{1}{z}\frac{d}{dz}\right)^{n}\cos z\;\quad(n=0,1,2,\ldots)
Modulus and Phase
j_{n}(z)=\sqrt[3]{2\pi/2}M_{n+1}(z)\cos\theta_{n+1}(z),\;\